      en: "The Cantemir Memorial in Moldova honors Dimitrie Cantemir, the 18th-century Moldavian prince and scholar. The memorial consists of a bronze statue on a granite pedestal, erected in 1973 on the 300th anniversary of his birth. Cantemir was a significant historian, author of „Descriptio Moldaviae”. The statue depicts him in princely attire with a book in hand. The surrounding square was redesigned in the 2000s.",
